# assistente utile U1+U2 (docs/plans/assistente-utile.md) — la situazione di chi
# parla esegue il piano di condotta insegnato parlando. I piani veri sono quelli
# salvati dalla sessione di addestramento (kb/core/messages.p0); qui si provano
# la meccanica, l'ablation e il ripristino, e il file lascia il piano com'era.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the speaker's problem runs the taught plan]
!timeout 30
> I have a problem with my bike.
<~ Let's look at it together.
<~ What is it, and what exactly happens?
> My phone screen is broken.
<~ Let's look at it together.
> the heating is broken
<~ Let's look at it together.

[test a settled problem and a topic named problem do not run it]
!timeout 30
> I solved the problem with my bike.
<! Let's look at it together
> the problem with this theory is its size
<! Let's look at it together

[test a worry is not answered as good news]
!timeout 30
> I'm really stressed about my exam tomorrow.
<~ That sounds hard
<! sounds nice
> I'm really happy about my exam result.
<! That sounds hard

[test the plan is taught knowledge: unlearn it and the situation says nothing]
!timeout 30
> unlearn what you do when someone has a problem
<~ Forgotten
> I have a problem with my bike.
<! Let's look at it together

[test a when-then lesson is a statement, a when-question is still a question]
!timeout 30
> when someone has a problem then say we will look at it together
<~ Held: in that situation, move 1
> when did someone have a problem?
<! Held
> when someone has a problem then remind them about safety
<~ move 2
> when someone has a problem then ask what it is and what happens
<~ move 3
<! refer to
> I have a problem with my bike.
<~ Let's look at it together. If something smokes
